        <div class="bi-howto-body">
            <p>A card&rsquo;s face carries what you decide with: the wait, what your heir needs, whether the solution works without the company, what you would have to renew, your heir&rsquo;s steps, the price, what distinguishes the solution and its catch. The row at the foot opens the rest in larger type: how the solution works in plain words, who holds which keys, the upkeep, the price in full, identity checks, what the provider doesn&rsquo;t publish, and the dated sources, with a link to the provider&rsquo;s own page. The address bar then names the solution, so one card can be linked to.</p>
